---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Base title="Now" description="What Kritikesh Rajpurohit is working on right now.">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Now</h1>
    <p class="muted">What I'm working on at the moment. Updated October 2026.</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Studying applied and agentic AI at IIIT Bangalore, and building projects as I go. Finished ones are in the <a href="/portfolio/">portfolio</a>.</li>
      <li>Writing a research paper on water poverty in the Bhil tribal region of Banswara, Rajasthan.</li>
      <li>Starting {SITE.blogBrand}, a blog of explainers that begin from the basics and climb.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
    <p>
      I want my work to be easy to find and easy to check. Projects live here under my own name; teaching and stories
      live here under {SITE.blogBrand}. Every other platform I use points back to this site.
    </p>
    <CtaBand />
  </article>
</Base>
